'''Hugh Pixel''' was an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Village}}. They gave out the {{Item|Dreamspire Torch}}, a [[Memento]] for Hypixel's twelfth anniversary that had no requirements to claim. {{Rmt|&6&lANNIVERSARY CINEMATIC}} was displayed below the {{Rmt|&cHugh Pixel}} name tag.

